ment of search, content management, and coding compliance solutions. He also served as Technical Director at Softscape and was the founder of an early web consulting firm CoolRiver. Involved with technology from an early age, he has been programming since the age of 7. While earning a degree in Computer Science and Mathematics from SUNY Albany, he had several internships pioneering early web technologies.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</section>\n    </main>\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<hr>\n        <footer class=\"container\">\n          <p>© <a href=\"http://opensourceconnections.com\">OpenSource Connections</a> 2025</p>\n        </footer>\n        <!-- Bootstrap core JavaScript\n        ================================================== -->\n        <!-- Placed at the end of the document so the pages load faster -->\n        <script src=\"https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.3.1.slim.min.js\" integrity=\"sha384-q8i/X+965DzO0rT7abK41JStQIAqVgRVzpbzo5smXKp4YfRvH+8abtTE1Pi6jizo\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>\n        <script>window.jQuery || document.write('<script src=\"../../assets/js/vendor/jquery-slim.min.js\"><\\/script>')</script>\n        <script src=\"/js/popper.min.js\"></script>\n        <script src=\"/js/bootstrap.min.js\"></script>\n    \n\n    \n\n</body></html>","error":null}},"type":"Object","created":"2025-06-15T13:19:13.806Z","ttl":0}